body: "The npm package pm-changelog@2026.5.24-1 includes docs/development.md with an absolute home path that trips pm-cli's tracked secret/static scan when the package is installed into .agents/pm/extensions.\\n\\nObserved in unbraind/pm-cli CI run 26346422405 static gate:\\n\\n`Potential secrets detected:`\\n`- .agents/pm/extensions/pm-changelog/docs/development.md:104 [absolute-home-path] redacted`\\n\\nExpected: published package docs should avoid host-specific absolute paths, or the package should omit development-only docs from the runtime tarball.\\n\\nThis is package-side packaging/docs hygiene; pm-cli should keep installing the published package as-is."
